  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1762658202_7769066_b356ed01d283653b94d1539e04f9a983.jpeg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"38\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"36\">About Our Brand and Products</strong></h3><p data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"551\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"59\">Iron Edge Supply</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>is where strength meets style in the kitchen. We specialize in premium, high-performance cookware and kitchen tools built for both passionate home cooks and professional chefs. From heavy-duty cast iron skillets and sleek stainless steel utensils to modern nonstick pans and rustic wooden accessories, our products are designed to last, combining durability, precision, and timeless design. Every piece is crafted to help customers cook boldly and confidently, no matter their skill level.</p><h3 data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"586\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"584\">What Makes Us Different</strong></h3><p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"989\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We don’t just sell cookware; we elevate the cooking experience. Unlike mass-produced kitchen brands, Iron Edge Supply focuses on quality craftsmanship, modern design, and affordable excellence. Our pieces are built to withstand daily use while maintaining a sleek, contemporary look. We prioritize function, aesthetics, and value equally, making professional-grade kitchenware accessible to everyone.</p><h3 data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1024\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1022\">How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1388\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Affiliates earn competitive commissions on every sale driven through their unique referral links. The more you share, the more you earn, with no cap on earnings. Payments are made on the 1st and 15th of each month. Affiliates also get early access to new product launches, special promotions, and exclusive seasonal campaigns to maximize their profit potential.</p><h3 data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1417\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; 